---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base>
  <h1>Build a 2D physics engine from scratch</h1>
  <p>
    A hands-on course. You write a rigid body engine in TypeScript, one small exercise at a time,
    against tests that already exist. Interactive visuals run the real algorithms so you can
    watch them work.
  </p>
  <p><a href={`${base}/course/`}><strong>Start the course →</strong></a></p>
  <p class="meta">Work in progress: modules 0 to 2 are drafted, the rest are coming.</p>
</Base>
